      "view": "PerspectiveCamera fov 13; distance fits (4.55 x 2.25) to the stage; camera y = distance x .06, looking at (0, -.08, 0); pivot tilt .045 rad",
      "shadow": "radial contact shadow plane 5.25 x 1.1 under the sign; opacity .6 light / .95 dark",
      "theme": "exposure 1.05 light / .95 dark; environment intensity 1 / .7; faces repainted from the dark set",
