  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button",
      "description": "Tonal default button; inverts to ink on hover.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-btn\" href=\"#\">read the essay</a>",
      "css": ".ds-btn{display:inline-block;border:1px solid var(--line,#dcdee3);color:var(--ink,#1d1e22);background:var(--card,#f8f9fa);padding:8px 16px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font:400 .85rem/1.6 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;transition:background .18s,border-color .18s,color .18s,transform .16s cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1)}.ds-btn:hover{background:var(--ink,#1d1e22);border-color:var(--ink,#1d1e22);color:var(--bg,#f0f1f3);transform:translateY(-1px)}.ds-btn:active{transform:scale(.97)}.ds-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#1d1e22);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Primary Action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "cta-primary",
      "description": "One audience-specific action per audience; accent pill with its paired on-colour.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-cta\" href=\"#\">start with this essay<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--acc,#2f6fe0);color:var(--on-acc,#fff);text-decoration:none;font:600 .95rem Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;padding:0 22px;min-height:48px;border-radius:999px;transition:transform .16s cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1),background-color .42s ease,color .42s ease}.ds-cta svg{transition:transform .2s cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1)}.ds-cta:hover svg{transform:translateX(3px)}.ds-cta:active{transform:scale(.97)}.ds-cta:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#1d1e22);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Audience Switch",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "audience-switch-on",
      "description": "Homepage tablist under \"who's reading?\"; accent pill indicator slides to the selected audience.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-aud\" role=\"tablist\"><span class=\"ds-ind\"></span><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">anyone</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">recruiters</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">finance</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">engineers</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-aud{--acc:#2f6fe0;--on-acc:#fff;position:relative;display:inline-flex;padding:4px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--card,#f8f9fa);border:1px solid var(--line,#dcdee3)}.ds-aud button{position:relative;z-index:1;font:500 .92rem Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--soft,#646873);background:none;border:0;padding:0 18px;min-height:44px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;transition:color .3s ease}.ds-aud button:hover{color:var(--ink,#1d1e22)}.ds-aud button[aria-selected=\"true\"]{color:var(--on-acc,#fff)}.ds-aud button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#1d1e22);outline-offset:3px}.ds-ind{position:absolute;top:4px;bottom:4px;left:79px;width:104px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--acc);transition:transform .42s cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1),width .42s cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1),background-color .42s ease}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Picked Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "pick-card",
      "description": "Homepage hand-picked writing: 4:3 image, meta with reading time, title.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-pick\" href=\"#\"><div class=\"ds-pick-img\"></div><div class=\"ds-pick-meta\">technology · 6 min read</div><div class=\"ds-pick-t\">clearline: why i built it</div></a>",
      "css": ".ds-pick{display:inline-grid;width:240px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink,#1d1e22);font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-pick-img{aspect-ratio:4/3;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line,#dcdee3);background:var(--card,#f8f9fa);transition:transform .3s cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1)}.ds-pick:hover .ds-pick-img{transform:translateY(-3px)}.ds-pick:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#1d1e22);outline-offset:3px}.ds-pick-meta{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--soft,#646873);margin:12px 0 4px}.ds-pick-t{font-weight:600;font-size:1.02rem;line-height:1.35}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Intro Link",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "",
      "description": "Linked code-like term inside a homepage intro: Inter italic, 2px accent underline.",
      "html": "<p class=\"ds-intro\">read <a class=\"ds-em\" href=\"#\">this.essay</a> or browse <a class=\"ds-em\" href=\"#\">my.projects</a></p>",
      "css": ".ds-intro{--acc:#2f6fe0;font:400 1.15rem/1.6 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#1d1e22);margin:0}.ds-em{color:inherit;font-style:italic;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--acc);text-decoration-thickness:2px;text-underline-offset:4px}.ds-em:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#1d1e22);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Segmented Control",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "segmented-on",
      "description": "Small multi-way switch on reading routes.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-seg\"><button class=\"ds-on\">all</button><button>essays</button><button>tools</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-seg{display:inline-flex;gap:2px;background:var(--card,#f8f9fa);border:1px solid var(--line,#dcdee3);border-radius:8px;padding:3px}.ds-seg button{font:400 .82rem Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;background:none;border:0;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 16px;color:var(--soft,#646873);cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,color .15s,transform .16s cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1)}.ds-seg button.ds-on{background:var(--ink,#1d1e22);color:var(--bg,#f0f1f3)}.ds-seg button:not(.ds-on):hover{color:var(--ink,#1d1e22)}.ds-seg button:active{transform:scale(.96)}.ds-seg button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#1d1e22);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "Linked card with thumbnail on reading routes.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-card\" href=\"#\"><div class=\"ds-card-img\"></div><div class=\"ds-card-t\">why i started a personal website</div></a>",
      "css": ".ds-card{display:block;width:220px;background:var(--card,#f8f9fa);border:1px solid var(--line,#dcdee3);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;color:var(--ink,#1d1e22);text-decoration:none;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;transition:border-color .18s,background .18s}.ds-card:hover{border-color:var(--soft,#646873);background:var(--hover,rgba(29,30,34,.05))}.ds-card:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#1d1e22);outline-offset:3px}.ds-card-img{aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:6px;background:var(--line,#dcdee3)}.ds-card-t{font-size:.85rem;font-weight:500;margin-top:10px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Input",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Subscribe field and its button.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-subrow\"><input class=\"ds-input\" placeholder=\"your email\"><button class=\"ds-subbtn\">subscribe</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-subrow{display:flex;gap:10px}.ds-input{background:var(--card,#f8f9fa);border:1px solid var(--line,#dcdee3);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;color:var(--ink,#1d1e22);font:400 .85rem Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-input::placeholder{color:var(--soft,#646873)}.ds-input:focus-visible,.ds-subbtn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#1d1e22);outline-offset:2px}.ds-subbtn{font:400 .85rem Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#1d1e22);background:var(--card,#f8f9fa);border:1px solid var(--line,#dcdee3);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 14px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .18s,border-color .18s,color .18s}.ds-subbtn:hover{background:var(--ink,#1d1e22);border-color:var(--ink,#1d1e22);color:var(--bg,#f0f1f3)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "",
      "description": "Top bar: wordmark left, route links right.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><a class=\"ds-logo\" href=\"#\">Etharic</a><span class=\"ds-right\"><a href=\"#\">2026</a><a class=\"ds-on\" href=\"#\">work</a><a href=\"#\">contact</a></span></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:30px 24px;background:var(--bg,#f0f1f3);font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-nav a{text-decoration:none;font-size:.95rem}.ds-logo{color:var(--ink,#1d1e22);font-weight:600;font-size:1.1rem;letter-spacing:-.01em}.ds-right{display:flex;gap:24px}.ds-right a{color:var(--soft,#646873);transition:color .18s}.ds-right a.ds-on,.ds-right a:hover{color:var(--ink,#1d1e22)}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#1d1e22);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "CV Link",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "cv-link",
      "description": "'get cv' on the homepage closing row: graphite ink, underline on hover.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-cv\" href=\"#\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><polyline points=\"14 2 14 8 20 8\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"13\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"13\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"17\"/></svg>get cv</a>",
      "css": ".ds-cv{color:var(--ink,#1d1e22);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;text-decoration:none;min-height:44px;font:500 .92rem Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-cv:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}.ds-cv:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#1d1e22);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Theme Switch",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "theme-switch",
      "description": "Light/dark toggle, fixed top right.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-switch\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"false\" aria-label=\"dark theme\"></button>",
      "css": ".ds-switch{position:relative;width:48px;height:27px;border-radius:999px;border:0;background:var(--track,#3a3a40);cursor:pointer;padding:0;transition:background .26s ease,transform .16s cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1)}.ds-switch::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;top:3px;left:3px;width:21px;height:21px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .26s cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1)}.ds-switch[aria-checked=\"true\"]{background:#4a4b52}.ds-switch[aria-checked=\"true\"]::after{transform:translateX(21px)}.ds-switch:active{transform:scale(.94)}.ds-switch:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#1d1e22);outline-offset:3px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "One Object on a Quiet Desk",
    "overview": "Etharic is one system with two registers. Every reading route (work, articles, about, 2026, contact) is a quiet desk: cool paper, graphite ink, hairline borders, Inter at reading sizes, flat surfaces. The homepage sets a single object on that desk: a slatted trivision sign, twelve square-section slats between two dark rails, with four faces, one per audience. Each face is a printed placard: a small tag (\"for recruiters\") over one large Archivo line (\"seen the numbers from both sides.\"). Choosing an audience turns the slats in a wave until the new face reads.\n\nThe homepage is one centred vertical axis: name, \"who's reading?\" and the audience switch, the sign, the intro, one audience-specific action plus \"more about me\", then a \"picked for\" heading, three hand-picked pieces of writing and a closing row. The audience is the only variable. Selecting one recolours the switch indicator, the primary action, the intro underlines and the \"picked for\" underline together, and turns the sign, so the whole axis shifts at once.\n\nThe voice is personal and playful (lowercase copy, code-like intro lines, a pixel dog, a live clock) but the surfaces are restrained. The sign is the one rendered object, matte and soft-lit; everything around it is flat. Rejected: corporate polish, glossy neon 3D, glass, decorative gradients and glow halos.",
